cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use SankeyQA, please cite the accompanying article and this software and data."
title: "SankeyQA, career-map Sankey diagrams with exact answers for testing vision-language models"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-17
abstract: >-
  An open benchmark of 600 artificial career cohorts (generated only to demonstrate and test the technology, not real data) drawn as career-map Sankey diagrams in the style of the
  XR-CareerAssist platform, with 6,560 questions whose answers are computed exactly from the underlying flow
  tables, twelve drawing styles, the code that generates the benchmark, evaluates small vision-language and
  language models and fine-tunes BLIP, and every model reply and result of the accompanying article.
